UID:Jm6UGbwz8WUMGEMcgClUo
SUMMARY:Free Watch Party: Norway vs England (4pm) and Argentina vs Switzerl
	and (8pm)
DTSTAMP:20260710T043050Z
DTSTART:20260711T143000Z
DESCRIPTION:Three days of quarterfinal madness wrap up tonight\, and the st
	akes couldn’t be higher. By the final whistle\, we’ll know our four semifi
	nalists. Don’t miss the moment it all becomes clear. \nKickoff for Norway 
	vs England is at 4:00 p.m. Kickoff for Argentina vs Switzerland is at 8:00
	 p.m. \nFood & Beverage Concessions: Visit Smalls Sliders for burgers\, fr
	ies\, and shakes\, stop by Franky’s for a gourmet hot dog or sausage\, and
	 cool down with Frios Gourmet Pops. Non-alcoholic drinks from Coca-Cola as
	 well as pre-packaged snacks can be purchased at the Community Partner Con
	cessions Booth\, proceeds benefiting Levy Park and the event’s community p
	artners. You can also stop by the park’s full-time concessionaires: Kind I
	ce Cream\, Hearsay\, and Gaspachos. \nCommunity Partners: Supporting this 
	event is the Houston Show Choir. Houston Show Choir is made up of talented
	 adult singers who perform an entertaining\, diverse repertoire with livel
	y choreography. They produce two big shows every year in June and December
	 and perform at community events throughout the year. Their vision is “to 
	share the joy of music”\, if that resonates with you\, auditions are in Au
	gust and January! Email director@houstonshowchoir or follow them on Facebo
	ok/Instagram for more info! \nActivities: Get into the tournament spirit w
	ith face and body art from Gio’s Art Kreations\, try your hand at our bubb
	le stations\, and enjoy coloring pages from featured teams. \nMerchandise:
	 Event merchandise celebrating Houston\, Levy Park\, and the global soccer
	 tournament will also be available for purchase. \nArt Installations and P
	hoto Opportunities: Commemorate the experience with a photo tour of the pa
	rk\, including life-sized soccer-themed photo backdrops and a tournament b
	racket. Visit our soccer ball music box and turn the crank for festive sou
	nds.\n\nhttps://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/quarterfinals-double-header
	/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/quarterfinals-double-header/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT9H
END:VEVENT
